  "explanation": "The question asks for Jingzong's father. The sources provide multiple references to different Jingzongs:\n\n1. **Emperor Jingzong of Tang**: D1S3 explicitly states that Emperor Jingzong of Tang was the eldest son of Emperor Muzong.\n2. **Emperor Jingzong of Western Xia**: D5S2 states that Emperor Jingzong of Western Xia was the eldest son of the Tangut ruler Li Deming.\n\nThese are distinct historical figures with different fathers. Therefore, both answers are valid depending on which Jingzong is being referenced."
}
